Package: bxp-gui
Version: 0.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgtk-3-0, libglib2.0-0, libstdc++6
Maintainer: BXP project <noreply@github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/zaxified/bxp
Description: Broker eXchange Parser - desktop config editor and debugger
 BXP is a Flutter desktop application that edits the JSON5 conversion
 configs used by the bxp-cli engine and exposes a per-row dry-run trace
 debugger. Ships the bxp-cli + bxp-fmt companion binaries inside the
 installation prefix so the GUI is self-contained.
